<!-- Abstract -->
<pre class='metadata'>
Abstract: <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Health-RI/metadata-documentation/main/src/images/HRI_Logo.png" alt="Health-RI Logo" title="Health-RI Logo" width="300"> <br/> The National Health Data Catalogue uses a core metadata schema: a set of minimal, common metadata elements for describing each resource (e.g., a dataset). The schema defines metadata requirements that support access to and reuse of information across Health-RI nodes via the National Catalogue. This document provides the technical specification for the Health-RI core metadata schema.
</pre>

